# Cloudflare connector MCP — API token + account id (co-located, NOT the product .env).
# Copy to `mcp/cloudflare/.env` (gitignored) and fill in the real token.
#
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN — Cloudflare API v4 SCOPED token, sent as
#                        `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Create it at
#                        https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens with:
#                          Zone:DNS:Edit · Zone:Zone:Read (+Edit to create zones)
#                          · Account:Cloudflare Tunnel:Edit
#                          (+ Account:Email Routing:Edit later for v2)
#                        SECRET — never commit the filled .env.
#
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID — the account id for the account-scoped tunnel
#                         endpoints (/accounts/{id}/cfd_tunnel). NOT a secret
#                         (it's the public account identifier from accounts_list).
#
# The base URL is fixed (https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4) — no per-tenant
# host. The connector sends a browser-style User-Agent automatically (pre-empts
# the Cloudflare WAF that 403-bans the default urllib UA).

CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=replace-with-your-scoped-cloudflare-api-token
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=replace-with-your-cloudflare-account-id
